{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09006","headline":"经少林精舍寄都邑亲友 · 韦应物","name":"经少林精舍寄都邑亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"息驾依松岭，高阁一攀缘。\n前瞻路已穷，既诣喜更延。\n出巘听万籁，入林濯幽泉。\n鸣钟生道心，暮磬空云烟。\n独往虽暂适，多累终见牵。\n方思结茅地，归息期暮年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}